# Frozen evidence (DE-040): stored byte-exact, never end-of-line converted. Each landing set's SHA256SUMS.txt
# records the sha256 of these bytes, and core.autocrlf=true would rewrite them on add and again on checkout.
*.patch -text
*.json -text
# The proof captures carry the CR bytes of the runs they quote, and the sets' SHA256SUMS.txt hash them too, so
# everything else in this packet is stored byte-exact as well.
* -text
